---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — Last Logged';
const description =
  'Privacy policy for Last Logged. Learn how we handle your data with a privacy-first approach.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Last Logged</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/#features">Features</a>
        <a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Content -->
  <main class="legal">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: March 24, 2026</p>

      <p>
        Pearson Media LLC (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) operates the
        Last Logged mobile application and the lastlogged.com website. This Privacy Policy explains
        how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our services.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are committed to a <strong>privacy-first approach</strong>. Last Logged is designed to
        work fully offline, and we collect as little data as possible.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        Last Logged collects <strong>minimal data</strong>. Your tracker items, completion logs, and
        categories are stored locally on your device using Apple&rsquo;s SwiftData framework. We do
        not have access to this data unless you explicitly opt in to cloud sync.
      </p>
      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We use <a href="https://telemetrydeck.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TelemetryDeck</a> for privacy-first analytics.
        TelemetryDeck does not collect personally identifiable information (PII). We track anonymous,
        aggregated events such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tracker items created</li>
        <li>Completions logged</li>
        <li>Widget interactions</li>
        <li>Onboarding completion</li>
        <li>Paywall impressions</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These events contain no names, email addresses, or device identifiers that could identify you
        personally.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Storage</h2>
      <h3>Local Storage</h3>
      <p>
        By default, all your data is stored locally on your device using SwiftData. This data never
        leaves your device unless you enable cloud sync by signing in to an account.
      </p>
      <h3>Cloud Sync (Optional)</h3>
      <p>
        If you choose to sign in with Apple or email, your data is synced to our cloud database
        hosted on <a href="https://supabase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supabase</a>. Supabase provides secure,
        encrypted storage with Row Level Security (RLS) policies that ensure only you can access your
        data. Cloud sync is entirely optional &mdash; the app is fully functional without it.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Last Logged integrates with the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>RevenueCat</strong> &mdash; Manages in-app subscriptions and purchases. RevenueCat
          processes transaction data as required by Apple. See the
          <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RevenueCat Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>TelemetryDeck</strong> &mdash; Privacy-first analytics. No PII collected. See the
          <a href="https://telemetrydeck.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TelemetryDeck Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Supabase</strong> &mdash; Cloud database and authentication (only if you opt in to
          sync). See the
          <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supabase Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Apple Sign In</strong> &mdash; Authentication service (only if you choose to sign
          in). Governed by
          <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>You have full control over your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Local data:</strong> You can clear all local data at any time from
          Settings &gt; Data &gt; Clear All Data within the app.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloud data:</strong> If you have cloud sync enabled, you can request deletion of
          your cloud data by contacting us at
          <a href="mailto:support@lastlogged.com">support@lastlogged.com</a>. We will delete your
          account and all associated data within 30 days.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Data export:</strong> You can export all your data in JSON or CSV format from the
          app&rsquo;s Settings screen before deleting it.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Last Logged is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information
        from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information,
        please contact us so we can promptly remove it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material
        changes by updating the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page. Your
        continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Pearson Media LLC</strong><br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:support@lastlogged.com">support@lastlogged.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="logo">Last Logged</span>
        <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Pearson Media LLC</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="mailto:support@lastlogged.com">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Header */
  .header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    z-index: 100;
  }

  .header .container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .logo:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .header nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .header nav a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .header nav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* Container */
  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Legal Content */
  .legal {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal li {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .legal {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .legal h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
